# Normalize line endings in the repository so that checkouts are identical
# on every platform. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows rewrites
# every text file to CRLF while the repository stores LF, and the ESLint
# linebreak-style rule fails the pre-commit hook with one error per line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched by the eol conversion above.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary